  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Preventive Healthcare Customer Service &amp; Quality Management Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the arrival of the novel coronavirus, USADF and LSETF collaborated to conduct a Request for Proposals focused on healthcare services, infection control and sanitation, and PPE production. Preventative Health Managers Limited, through a competitive application process, was chosen to receive grant financing from USADF and LSETF. Preventative Health Managers Limited is proposing training in infection prevention and communication for 100 unemployed Lagos State residents. They will train 2 batches of 50 students over an 8 week curriculum leading to employment opportunities in hospitals, laboratories, and other local entities.</narrative>
  </description>
